# Pages rejects `/* /index.html 200`: /index.html strips back to `/` and matches the splat, so the rule is ignored.
# 404.html stays, so a missing file, including /assets/*, is 404.
# These routes serve the built shell with status 200 and keep the URL.
# Static rules stay above placeholders.
